# The surface theme, thirty seconds, one tick a frame.
#
# Song $04 (`surface`) is requested on the first tick and never again:
# the engine latches `songRequest` into `songPlaying` and clears it, so a
# script that repeated the request would be re-initialising the song every
# frame. Thirty seconds is 1792 frames at the Game Boy's 59.73 Hz, the same
# window `zig build audiocost` measures over.
